  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gelephu Flood Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop2Build and the Ministry of Works and Human Settlement (Flood Engineering and Management Division) are working together to identify suitable and sustainable infrastructural flood protection intervention(s) and / or mitigation intervention(s) alongside the Mao River in order to reduce Gelephus vulnerability to floods of the Mao River.</narrative>
  </description>
